+<!--en-->
+The assembly is the same shape the recursion chapters share. The site
+instantiates the value property, the entries predicate, and the step pair.
+<!--zh-->
+这个装配就是两部递归章共享的那个形状。此处在值性质、条目谓词与步进对上实例化它。
+<!--/-->
+
+```agda
+module A = Assembly
+  (λ c z → fst z ≡ Lset c)
+  (λ c z → setIsSet (fst z) (Lset c))
+  (λ h B c c∈ → ⟨ pr (fst c) (Lset (fst c)) ∈ fst h ⟩)
+  (λ h B C e e∈B e∈C x → x)
+  (λ c x y p q → Σ≡Prop (λ t → snd (isL t)) (p ∙ sym q))
+  StepAt
+  (λ v b f γ ob vals ents h → step-Lset v b f γ h ob vals ents)
+  (λ v b f γ ob vals ents sp → step-table v b f γ ob vals ents sp)
+  (λ f a γ h oa u hu ou u∈a IH c c∈ →
+     PT.rec (snd (pr (fst c) (Lset (fst c)) ∈ fst (lookup f γ)))
+       (λ { (y , q) → subst (λ t → ⟨ pr (fst c) t ∈ fst (lookup f γ) ⟩)
+           (IH (fst c) c∈ (snd c) (mem-ord {A = u} ou (fst c) c∈) y q) q })
+       (domAt-in f a γ (h .fst) c (oa .fst {x = u} {y = fst c} c∈ u∈a)))
+  (λ w b γ f ha ob vals c c∈ →
+     PT.rec (snd (pr (fst c) (Lset (fst c)) ∈ fst f))
+       (λ { (y , q) → subst (λ t → ⟨ pr (fst c) t ∈ fst f ⟩) (vals c y c∈ q) q })
+       (domAt-in zero (suc b) (f ∷ γ) (ha .fst) c c∈))
+  (λ w b γ h ob ents c c∈ → ∣ LsetS (fst c)
+     (mem-ord {A = fst (lookup b γ)} ob (fst c) c∈) , ents c c∈ ∣₁)
+```
